          %title Abelian Chern-Simons for fractional quantum Hall effect
          %h3#ReferencesAbCSForFQHE Abelian Chern-Simons for fractional quantum Hall effect
          %p
            The idea of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelian+Chern-Simons+theory"} abelian Chern-Simons theory
            as an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/effective+field+theory"} effective field theory
            exhibiting the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fractional+quantum+Hall+effect"} fractional quantum Hall effect
            (abelian
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+order"} topological order
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steven+M.+Girvin"}> Steven M. Girvin
                , around (10.7.15) in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Summary, Omissions and Unanswered Questions
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Quantum Hall Effect
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4612-3350-3"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4612-3350-3
            %li#GirvinMacDonald87
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steven+M.+Girvin"}> Steven M. Girvin
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Allan+H.+MacDonald"} Allan H. MacDonald
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Off-diagonal long-range order, oblique confinement, and the fractional quantum Hall effect
                %strong 58
                12 (1987) (1987) 1252-1255 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.58.1252"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.58.1252
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shou+Cheng+Zhang"}> Shou Cheng Zhang
                , T. H. Hansson S. Kivelson:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Effective-Field-Theory Model for the Fractional Quantum Hall Effect
                %strong 62
                (1989) 82 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.62.82"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.62.82
                ]
          %p and was made more explicit in:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"}> Xiao-Gang Wen
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anthony+Zee"} Anthony Zee
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Quantum statistics and superconductivity in two spatial dimensions
                %strong 15
                (1990) 135-156 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0920-5632(90)90014-L"}> doi:10.1016/0920-5632(90)90014-L
                ]
            %li#BlokWen90
              %p
                B. Blok,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"} Xiao-Gang Wen
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Effective theories of the fractional quantum Hall effect at generic filling fractions
                %strong 42
                (1990) 8133 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.42.8133"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.42.8133
                ]
            %li#Wen90Rigid
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"}> Xiao-Gang Wen
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological Orders in Rigid States
                %strong 4
                239 (1990) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0217979290000139"}> doi:10.1142/S0217979290000139
                ]
            %li#WenNiu90
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"}> Xiao-Gang Wen
                , Qian Niu:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Ground state degeneracy of the FQH states in presence of random potential and on high genus Riemann surfaces
                %strong 41
                9377 (1990) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.41.9377"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.41.9377
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J%C3%BCrg+Fr%C3%B6hlich"}> Jürg Fröhlich
                , T. Kerler:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Universality in quantum Hall systems
                %strong 354
                2–3 (1991) 369-417 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(91)90360-A"}> doi:10.1016/0550-3213(91)90360-A
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J%C3%BCrg+Fr%C3%B6hlich"}> Jürg Fröhlich
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anthony+Zee"} Anthony Zee
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Large scale physics of the quantum hall fluid
                %strong 364
                3 (1991) 517-540 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(91)90275-3"}> doi:10.1016/0550-3213(91)90275-3
                ]
            %li
              %p
                Z. F. Ezawa, A. Iwazaki:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Chern-Simons gauge theories for the fractional-quantum-Hall-effect hierarchy and anyon superconductivity
                %strong 43
                (1991) 2637 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.43.2637"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.43.2637
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A.+P.+Balachandran"}> A. P. Balachandran
                , A. M. Srivastava:
                %em Chern-Simons Dynamics and the Quantum Hall Effect
                [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9111006"}> arXiv:hep-th/9111006
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/319826"} spire:319826
            %li
              %p
                Ana Lopez,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eduardo+Fradkin"} Eduardo Fradkin
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Fractional quantum Hall effect and Chern-Simons gauge theories
                %strong 44
                (1991) 5246 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.44.5246"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.44.5246
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://home.ustc.edu.cn/~gengb/200923/Fradkin,%20Field%20Theories%20of%20Condensed%20Matter%20Physics.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"}> Xiao-Gang Wen
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anthony+Zee"} Anthony Zee
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological structures, universality classes, and statistics screening in the anyon superfluid
                %strong 44
                (1991) 274 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.44.274"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.44.274
                ]
            %li#IengoLechner92
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Roberto+Iengo"}> Roberto Iengo
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kurt+Lechner"} Kurt Lechner
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Anyon quantum mechanics and Chern-Simons theory
                %strong 213
                4 (1992) 179-269 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-1573(92)90039-3"}> doi:10.1016/0370-1573(92)90039-3
                ]
            %li#WenZee92Classification
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"}> Xiao-Gang Wen
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anthony+Zee"} Anthony Zee
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Classification of Abelian quantum Hall states and matrix formulation of topological fluids
                %strong 46
                (1992) 2290 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevB.46.2290"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.46.2290
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"}> Xiao-Gang Wen
                ,
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anthony+Zee"} Anthony Zee
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Shift and spin vector: New topological quantum numbers for the Hall fluids
                %strong 69
                (1992) 953, Erratum Phys. Rev. Lett.
                %strong 69
                3000 (1992) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.953"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.953
                ]
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"}> Xiao-Gang Wen
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Theory of Edge States in Fractional Quantum Hall Effects
                %strong 06
                10 (1992) 1711-1762 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0217979292000840"}> doi:10.1142/S0217979292000840
                ]
            %li#Wen95
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xiao-Gang+Wen"}> Xiao-Gang Wen
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological orders and Edge excitations in FQH states
                %strong 44
                (1995) 405 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1080/00018739500101566"}> doi:10.1080/00018739500101566
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/cond-mat/9506066"} arXiv:cond-mat/9506066
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (in the context of
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %em
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+order"} topological order
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/A.+P.+Balachandran"}> A. P. Balachandran
                , L. Chandar, B. Sathiapalan:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Chern-Simons Duality and the Quantum Hall Effect
                %strong A11
                (1996) 3587-3608 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/S0217751X96001693"}> doi:10.1142/S0217751X96001693
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
